+# Programme state — 13 September 2026
+
+The source remains the original split-supported arithmetic theta complex over
+b_tau, with G(Z)->Z of infinite target, its coefficient map to G(C), its original
+internal relations, and the actual cyclic sum packet. No source metric is freely
+selected.
+
+## Inherited update now used
+
+PR #25 and concurrent main strengthen the two-block lower threshold to 4. Each
+length-q block has a lower log volume of 2q log(D_h k), under the hypothetical
+exact off-line quartet. The first degree q-1 has its own local theorem. The
+norm-window envelope is a written analytic result; the formal finite propagation
+has the source's reported Lean receipt.
+
+## Added this turn
+
+1. The positive inverse-restriction cost Z=(K_j-K_i)G_i with its exact source
+   adjoint and retained arithmetic commutator.
+2. Source formulas for tr Z, tr Z^2, and the second exterior area, including all
+   cross-pairings and norms of the original correction map.
+3. The classical sharp two-trace determinant bound applied to this same cost,
+   with a complete positive remainder, equality characterization, and a third-
+   trace improvement. Its finite spectral cap is derived from the same traces.
+4. A rational-enclosure certificate needing no separate minimum-restriction-gap
+   premise, and the direct composition with the current two-volume window bound.
+5. A necessary independent-area growth inequality in the off-line branch, on
+   each original relation block. Its opposing arithmetic growth bound is open
+   in this work; no uniform upper estimate is asserted.
+
+## Quantities for the next analytic calculation
+
+For the two fixed degree blocks, estimate the actual sums
+
+    t1=sum b_n*G_i b_n/omega_n,
+    area2=sum_(n<m) det Gram_Gi(b_n,b_m)/(omega_n omega_m).
+
+The exact two-trace cap retains covariance rather than replacing it by independent
+column magnitudes. Existing gamma moment enclosures and the parallel session's
+finite-metric error bounds may supply certified inputs; their use must retain
+the actual jet unit and the original inverse G_i. The present note supplies no
+new uniform control of those inputs.
+
+No remote branch or frozen publication was modified. Package proofs and bounded
+finite targets can be integrated additively by the existing publication owner.
